  PROSE AND INLINE
  downcroc writes the message down, gives it a name, and only 
  then sends it. Once the message is written down, you can see 
  it, retry it if something goes wrong, and never wonder whether
  it left.
  
  prose tones / widths
  Lead prose establishes context before the detailed steps 
  follow.
  downcroc writes the message down, gives it a 
  name, and only then sends it. Once the message 
  is written down, you can see it, retry it if 
  something goes wrong, and never wonder whether 
  it left.
  Muted prose can carry secondary guidance without competing.
  
